<title>UK: Chelsea places 750,000 shares at 110p each.</title>
<headline>Chelsea places 750,000 shares at 110p each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Chelsea Village Plc, the holding company that owns Chelsea football club, said it was placing 750,000 new ordinary shares at 110p each on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company said the shares were being placed through its brokers, Ellis &amp; Partners Ltd. It has agreed to issue another 20,000 shares to the brokers for their fee.</p>
<p>The shares are due for issue on December 31, 1996 and the company will apply for the shares to be admitted to AIM.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
